# ABC script for the timing-driven mapping (SYNTH_ABC=speed, D-041). Best-possible delay, no period target: a target tighter than
# the tool can reach changes nothing (measured on the L1-I), and a looser one only recovers area.
# &nf maps for delay, buffer inserts fan-out buffers (the raw netlist has nets with a fan-out of 500), upsize and dnsize resize
# gates by their real load; stime reports the result.
&get -n
&st
&nf
&put
buffer -c
topo
stime -c
upsize
dnsize
